分識別。之後無法自動還原附屬於這些網站的付費授權;你需要透過 %2$s 聯絡 Babilim 支援。如要保留身分識別,請按「取消」,在各網站的 Babilim 設定中取消勾選「解除安裝時刪除所有 Babilim 資料」,然後再次停用。仍要停用嗎?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'此網絡的網站數目過多,無法逐一檢查,其中部分網站可能設定為在刪除外掛時清除其 Babilim 身分識別。之後無法自動還原附屬於這類網站的付費授權;你需要透過 %s 聯絡 Babilim 支援。如要保留身分識別,請按「取消」,在各網站的 Babilim 設定中取消勾選「解除安裝時刪除所有 Babilim 資料」,然後再次停用。仍要停用嗎?','Open Babilim settings'=>'開啟 Babilim 設定','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim 無法驗證此網站，因此不會下載或安裝任何內容。','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'服務無法連線到你的網站。可能是防火牆、安全性外掛或主機規則封鎖了請求；請允許對 /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge 的請求。','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'你的網站回應時間過長。請稍後再試，並檢查主機是否過慢或負載過高。','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'你的網站有回應，但內容與預期不符。REST API 可能被其他外掛改寫，或該端點已被快取；請將 /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge 排除於快取與改寫之外。','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'請檢查你的網站是否可從互聯網存取，然後再試一次。','Re-verify'=>'重新驗證','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'此網站超出服務單次同步可接受的大小，因此部分項目已被略過：%1$d 個元件及 %2$d 個語言版本。','This site is verified.'=>'此網站已通過驗證。','Registration restarted.'=>'已重新開始註冊。','Sync complete.'=>'同步完成。