lim 正在啟用並檢查此網站……（上次嘗試：%s）','Check again'=>'重新檢查','No components synced yet.'=>'尚未同步任何元件。','%d succeeded'=>'%d 個成功','%d skipped'=>'%d 個已略過','%d failed'=>'%d 個失敗','%d not yet tried'=>'%d 個尚未嘗試','%1$s nothing to do.'=>'%1$s無需處理。','%1$s %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s。','Bulk download:'=>'批次下載:','Bulk update:'=>'批次更新:','Bulk request:'=>'批次請求:','per day'=>'每日','Wrong meaning'=>'意思錯誤','Wrong term'=>'術語錯誤','Broken placeholder'=>'佔位符損壞','Wrong for this context'=>'不適用於此語境','Wrong plural form'=>'複數形式錯誤','Negation reversed'=>'否定意思相反','Translation does not load'=>'翻譯無法載入','problem report categoryOther'=>'其他','%1$s (%2$s): %3$s'=>'%1$s（%2$s）：%3$s','Continuing…'=>'正在繼續…','Continue next batch (%d left)'=>'繼續下一批（尚餘 %d 項）','Search components'=>'搜尋元件','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'這些是此網站使用的語言。你可以在 %s 中更改。','Upload this component?'=>'要上載此元件嗎?','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'目前沒有等待確認的上載。','Back'=>'返回','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'要翻譯此元件，Babilim 需要取得其原始碼。','The entire plugin or theme directory of %1$s (version %2$s) will be uploaded to Babilim.'=>'%1$s（版本 %2$s）的整個外掛或佈景主題目錄將會上載至 Babilim。','If that directory contains keys, logs or customer data, they will be uploaded too. The service removes common sensitive files (configuration, environment, database dumps, logs, keys) but cannot guarantee it finds everything.'=>'如果該目錄包含金鑰、記錄檔或客戶資料，這些內容也會一併上載。服務會移除常見的敏感檔案（設定檔、環境檔、資料庫傾印檔、記錄檔、金鑰），但無法保證能找出所有檔案。','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'上載的內容會保留，直至你要求 Babilim 刪除為止。','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'內容由服務的主機供應商儲存，並由 AI 模型處理以產生翻譯。','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'原文及據此製作的翻譯,將會提供給安裝相同版本的其他網站。','By continuing you confirm that you have the right to upload this component.'=>'繼續即表示你確認自己有權上載此元件。','Upload and request'=>'上載並請求','Uploading…'=>'上載中…','