ed. This site is now licensed.'=>'購買已還原，此網站現已獲得授權。','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'此網站沒有可顯示還原碼的購買記錄。','Could not show a new restore code: %s'=>'無法顯示新的還原碼:%s','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'你的新還原碼:%s。請妥善保管——先前的還原碼已失效。','What is sent when Babilim checks this site'=>'Babilim 檢查此網站時會傳送的資料','(detected)'=>'（已偵測）','No language is managed yet.'=>'尚未管理任何語言。','Babilim adds translations for every language checked here.'=>'Babilim 會為此處勾選的每種語言新增翻譯。','Add another language'=>'新增其他語言','Choose a language…'=>'選擇語言…','Could not load the full WordPress.org locale list from the service, so no other language can be added right now.'=>'無法從服務載入完整的 WordPress.org 語言區域清單，因此目前無法新增其他語言。','Theme'=>'佈景主題','Plugin'=>'外掛','Free quota'=>'免費配額','Downloads: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)'=>'下載次數：%1$d/%2$d（%3$s）','Supplementary translation index'=>'補充翻譯索引','Built'=>'已建置','Included'=>'已納入','Excluded'=>'已排除','Already in WordPress core'=>'已包含於 WordPress 核心','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'補充翻譯維護','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'目前無法取得維護狀態。','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'清理作業已於 %1$s 暫停：%2$s。未有刪除任何內容。','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'上次清理於 %1$s：新標記 %2$d 項，已刪除 %3$d 個檔案，已移除 %4$d 筆記錄。','No cleanup has run yet.'=>'尚未執行任何清理。','A translation-index write conflicted with another request on %1$s (%2$s) and was not applied; the most recent version was kept.'=>'在 %1$s 寫入翻譯索引（%2$s）時，與另一個請求發生衝突，因此未有套用；已保留最新版本。','A translation-index write on %1$s (%2$s) could not be completed and was not applied (%3$s).'=>'在 %1$s 寫入翻譯索引（%2$s）未能完成，因此未有套用（%3$s）。','Maintenance'=>'維護','Rebuild index now'=>'立即重建索引','Sweep now'=>'立即清理','Danger zone'=>'危險區域','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'移除 Babilim 為此網站上所有外掛與佈景主題安裝的全部語言檔案。','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it ins