'=>'已安裝 · 為其他版本建置，新版本需要付費授權','Installed · built for %s, free quota used'=>'已安裝 · 為 %s 建置，已用盡免費配額','Installed · built for a different version, free quota used'=>'已安裝 · 為其他版本建置，已用盡免費配額','translation statusAvailable'=>'可用','Installed · %s'=>'已安裝 · %s','Available · %s'=>'可用 · %s','Update'=>'更新','Download'=>'下載','Updating…'=>'更新中…','Downloading…'=>'下載中…','Retry request'=>'重試請求','Request newer translation'=>'請求較新的翻譯','Request translation'=>'請求翻譯','Requesting…'=>'請求中…','Requesting a translation uses one of your free slots, unless this component already uses one. A failed translation does not give the slot back.'=>'請求翻譯會使用一個免費名額，除非此元件已佔用一個名額。翻譯失敗不會退還名額。','If this component does not use one of your free slots yet, requesting a translation uses one. A failed translation does not give the slot back. Continue?'=>'如果此元件尚未佔用免費名額，請求翻譯會使用一個名額。翻譯失敗不會退還名額。要繼續嗎？','No plugins or themes found.'=>'找不到外掛或佈景主題。','Clear filters'=>'清除篩選條件','No components match these filters. %s'=>'沒有元件符合這些篩選條件。%s','Select all'=>'全選','All'=>'全部','Available'=>'可用','Updates'=>'更新','Requestable'=>'可請求','Installed'=>'已安裝','Plugins'=>'外掛','Themes'=>'佈景主題','All languages'=>'所有語言','%d to install'=>'%d 項待安裝','Language:'=>'語言：','Bulk actions apply to every matching language of each selected component.'=>'批量操作會套用於每個已選元件的所有相符語言。','Bulk actions apply only to the selected language of each selected component.'=>'批量操作只會套用於每個已選元件的所選語言。','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','Theme · %s'=>'佈景主題 · %s','Plugin · %s'=>'外掛 · %s','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'要從此網站移除 %1$s 的 %2$s 翻譯嗎？','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'要將 %1$s 的 %2$s 翻譯回滾至上一個建置版本嗎？','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s:%2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s:%2$s(%3$s)','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'註冊驗證請求的格式不符預期。','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'這不是有效的建置識別碼。','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'拒絕寫入 Babilim 語言檔案目錄以外的位置。','Could not write the downloaded package to disk.'=>'無法將下載的套件寫入磁碟。','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'未預期的 HTTP %d 回應。','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'此網站的網址,讓服務可驗證你擁有該網站。','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'你的 WordPress 版本,用於提供相容的翻譯檔案。','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'你的 PHP 版本,用於確認相容性。','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'此外掛本身的版本,若版本過舊而無法與服務通訊,服務可通知你更新。','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'此網站已設定的語言區域。','Every locale in use on this site (site locale, installed language packs, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'此網站使用中的所有語言區域（網站語言區域、已安裝的語言包、使用者語言區域，以及你手動新增的語言區域）。各語言區域一視同仁，不會區別對待。','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'(為此網站產生的公開金鑰)','This site\'s install public key, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent.'=>'此網站的安裝公開金鑰，用於證明請求確實來自此網站。只會傳送金鑰配對中的公開金鑰部分。','Every installed plugin/theme: its slug, version, text domain(s), whether it\'s a wp.org listing, its own bundled locales, and which locales you\'ve already installed a Babilim translation for.'=>'每個已安裝的外掛／佈景主題：其 slug、版本、文字域、是否為 wp.org 上架項目、自身內附的語言區域，以及你已安裝 Babilim 翻譯的語言區域。','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: that component\'s entire directory, as a zip.'=>'只有在你確認上載並非位於 WordPress.org 的外掛或佈景主題時:該元件的整個目錄(以 zip 格式)。','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(僅限通用代碼和座標)','Up to 20 pending diagnostic events (e.g. a file that failed its integrity check), each just a code, component, and locale, and never any string content or translated text.'=>'最多 20 個待處理的診斷事件（例如未通過完整性檢查的檔案），每個事件只包含代碼、元件和語言區域，絕不包含任何字串內容或翻譯文字。','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'不安全的語言區域：%s','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'無法取得 manifest：%s','Could not determine active components; the existing merged index was left unchanged.'=>'無法判斷使用中的元件;現有的合併索引維持不變。','Could not determine installed plugins/themes; sweep skipped, nothing was deleted.'=>'無法判斷已安裝的外掛／佈景主題；已略過清理，未有刪除任何內容。','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'清理已中止，未有任何項目被標記為孤立項目：%s。','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'清理已執行，但部分變更未能記錄到翻譯索引中；下次清理時會再次嘗試。','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'佈景主題','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'外掛','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'這會使所有受管理的%1$s元件變成孤立項目（共 %2$d 個中的 %2$d 個）','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'這會令 %2$d 個受管理的元件中有 %1$d 個成為孤立項目（超過一半）','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'「%s」的合併索引已重建,但翻譯索引無法記錄;下次重建會重試。','Could not write the staged merged index.'=>'無法寫入暫存合併索引。','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'重新解析的項目數量與建立的索引不符。','Could not move the merged index for \'%s\' into place; the previous served index (if any) was removed rather than left half-updated. No default-domain supplement is served for this locale until the next successful rebuild.'=>'無法將「%s」的合併索引移到指定位置；先前已提供的索引（如有）已被移除，而非留下半更新的狀態。在下次成功重建之前，此語言區域不會提供預設文字域補充。','Could not open zip: %s'=>'無法開啟 zip:%s','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Zip 內沒有 manifest.json。','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'Zip 內的 manifest.json 不是有效的 JSON。','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'manifest.json 的「%s」與預期值不符。','Another installation is running; try again in a moment.'=>'另一個安裝程序正在執行,請稍後再試。','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'不是有效的 server_build_id：%s','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'套件 manifest 的 kind「%1$s」與要求的 kind「%2$s」不符。','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'套件的文字域「%1$s」與本網站的元件副本（「%2$s」）不符，因此未有安裝。','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'指定的文字域「%1$s」既不符合套件 manifest 本身的 slug「%2$s」，也不符合其 text_domain「%3$s」。','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'不安全的 slug:%s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'不安全的 text_domain:%s','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'套件內沒有其本身文字域的 %s。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「%s」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「entries」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「files」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「extra_domains」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「build_no」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'manifest.json 的「server_build_id」不是有效的建置 ID。','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'manifest.json 的「contract」不是有效的版本字串。','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'manifest.json 的「status」必須是「published」。','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'manifest.json 的「kind」必須是「plugin」或「theme」。','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json 的「default_domain_entries」無效。','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json 的「default_domain_files」無效。','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest 缺少「%s」，或該欄位無效。','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'expected_manifest 的「server_build_id」不是有效的建置 ID。','No record for %s'=>'找不到 %s 的記錄','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'一個或多個已提供的檔案與 manifest 不再相符。','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'沒有可回滾的先前建置。','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'無法將變更記錄到翻譯索引，請再試一次。','Unknown kind: %s'=>'未知的類型：%s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'不安全的文字域：%s','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'文字域「%1$s」(%2$s) 已為另一個已安裝的元件 (%3$s) 提供，因此未有安裝任何內容。','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'回滾會覆寫「%1$s」（%2$s），而該檔案現已提供給另一個已安裝的元件（%3$s），未變更任何內容。','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Zip 缺少預期的檔案：%s','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的 sha256 不相符','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'套件未宣告主要翻譯檔案。','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Zip 缺少預期的 default 檔案：%s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'default/%s 的 sha256 不相符','Could not stage %s'=>'無法暫存 %s','Could not stage default/%s'=>'無法暫存 default/%s','Entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的條目數量不相符','Could not verify entry count for %s'=>'無法驗證 %s 的條目數量','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的 l10n.php 項目數量不相符','Default supplement entry count mismatch.'=>'default 補充檔的條目數量不相符。','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'套件未產生可供使用的主要翻譯檔案。','Could not prepare %s for rollback.'=>'無法為回滾準備 %s。','Could not back up %s before replacing it.'=>'在取代 %s 之前無法備份。','Could not move %s into place.'=>'無法將 %s 移至指定位置。','Could not read %s back after moving it into place.'=>'將 %s 移到指定位置後，無法重新讀取該檔案。','English (United States)'=>'英文（美國）','Babilim_Manifest is unavailable: %s'=>'Babilim_Manifest 無法使用：%s','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'無法讀取 _manifest.json：%s','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'無法解析 _manifest.json：%s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json 的結構不符預期','Could not create the package archive.'=>'無法建立套件封存檔。','No writable temporary directory is available for packaging.'=>'沒有可供打包使用的可寫入暫存目錄。','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'元件中有檔案無法讀取，因此未有打包。','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'只有外掛和佈景主題可以打包。','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'找不到元件的主檔案。','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'此元件不在外掛或佈景主題目錄內。','Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check.'=>'Babilim 在此步驟中逾時，將於下次檢查時繼續。','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds.'=>'Babilim 無法驗證此網站，因此在驗證成功之前不會下載或安裝任何內容。','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'註冊回應缺少必要欄位。','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'沒有待驗證的挑戰。','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'驗證回應缺少 site_token。','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'輪換權杖回應缺少 site_token。','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce 必須是十六進位字串。','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'此 nonce 沒有待處理的驗證要求。','Too many requests.'=>'請求次數過多。','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'服務要求本網站稍後再同步。','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'本網站有 %1$d 個元件，涵蓋 %2$d 種語言，需要 %3$d 個檢查批次；Babilim 每次執行最多可處理 %4$d 個。請在「設定」中減少受管理的語言，或停用未使用的外掛和佈景主題，然後按「重新檢查」。','Babilim could not finish checking this site.'=>'Babilim 無法完成對此網站的檢查。','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'此網站的網址太長，Babilim 無法註冊。','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'此網站的語言區域代碼並非 Babilim 可以註冊的代碼。','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'下載回應缺少可用的位置。','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'服務提供的上傳資料不完整。','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'此元件超出服務可接受的大小，因此無法上傳。','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'無法讀取已打包的元件。','A part of the upload kept failing, so the upload was cancelled.'=>'上傳的其中一部分多次失敗，因此已取消上傳。','Could not read: %s'=>'無法讀取：%s','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'沒有已存檔的網站 ID，無法為其輪換權杖。']];